4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mG612EpTeyIQ7kNvwH4sM34&_nc_oc=AdoebbK94OQdPn54AvvPcYopRB-BSCYF3ga7b_rsZXr0gJvfJ5w4lx4RaqrYUa8puRo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3KWt5CPq8KrYb6uOBqXZbc3-wXdneYgXDGOxqgmRsgxQ&oe=69DF8CD4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Hy1ZIrF_P6cQ7kNvwEvRglN&_nc_oc=AdrclULsy8UgbS_LzrcOpys2ghJZeP8RcTKHE2KqoO_lCDyY8Uwdbky2OuyLeGZ8L_4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3MEmnpE9hK__4D7rq8OS1UGQM4DV1gFz99xHUcLmX-9w&oe=69DF91B2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3IojpnmvHf0Q7kNvwG13v9_&_nc_oc=AdrO3-J2CxVA11Jj-5QVKLUj3JDJovyi1YpczIBbBPssmat5TXdN9CM-Fcg1na6TZ3g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3q_C7_PsLrJtUPIqDB50ETTl-9FTvnpVD1m6rZM9WRkg&oe=69DF9F55"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p